## Interface: 120005,120007
## Title: Cairn-2.0
## Notes: A modern alternative to Ace3 for WoW addon authors. Composable libraries (Addon, DB, Slash, Events, Locale, Log, Util, Hooks, Timer, Settings, Callback, Media) with a flagship Settings library that bridges to Blizzard's native Settings panel and registers EditMode anchors. Hybrid distribution: works as a standalone shared addon OR LibStub-embedded.
## Author: ChronicTinkerer
## Version: 1
## SavedVariables: CairnDB
